{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-solovay-theorem.md","title":"Solovay's Arithmetical Completeness Theorem","display":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Arithmetical Completeness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","aliases":["89-thm-solovay-theorem"],"display":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Arithmetical Completeness Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-solovay-theorem]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-lem-solovay-lem2]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-solovay-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-solovay-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-theorem — Solovay's Arithmetical Completeness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cc7f2e21119da30\" href=\"?note=1cc7f2e21119da30\" title=\"89-df-solovay-theorem\">89-df-solovay-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b7050f6732cc53d7\" href=\"?note=b7050f6732cc53d7\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-lem2\">89-lem-solovay-lem2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 取原有定义，即 GL 恰等于全部实现下 PA 可证的模态公式集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Solovay}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n正向由 Hilbert–Bernays–Löb 条件及 GL 证明归纳得算术可靠性。逆向：非 GL 定理先有有限反模型，再由自指极限句构造得到 PA 不可证的实现。标准 PA 的可靠性在通常元理论中可由公理真与推理保真建立；这里显式保留原书证明使用的条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1cc7f2e21119da30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-lem2","status":"reso